        "903a3729-8168-4222-a90e-06c8a6401eb2": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 448,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 200,
            "content": "## Test hook\n\nCalls `appmixer-echo` on the OpenClaw gateway of the account. That hook runs no agent: its transform posts a progress update (`\"final\": false`) and then the received payload (`\"status\": \"passed\"`) to the Call Hook callback URL, so Out, Progress and Done all fire within seconds.\n\nOn another gateway, deploy `.github/openclaw/appmixer-echo/` of Appmixer-ai/appmixer-components (transform + mapping + proxy location) first."
        }
